            {/* Without this, a Booked date being clickable at all is invisible —
                 cursor:pointer/a hover ring are easy to miss, and there's nothing to
                 notice on a touch device until you happen to tap one. Shown
                 unconditionally (not just on touch) since a mouse user hovering a
                 date without knowing anything happens is the same discoverability
                 gap, just solved by a different affordance. Icon travels with its
                 own text as one toggled group (display:contents — see styles.css),
                 not one shared icon for both, so a touch visitor never sees a
                 mouse-pointer glyph next to "Tap it...". */}
            <div class="availability-note">
